{"id":"634594","name":"蚝仔煎","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/634594/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"生蚝肉","amount":"650g"}],"sub":[{"name":"红薯粉","amount":"150g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3g"},{"name":"姜粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"蚝肉用面粉轻轻抓洗几遍，再洗净沥干。","img":"images/634594/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"蚝肉放入碗中，加红薯粉。","img":"images/634594/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/634594/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加姜粉和盐拌匀，醒十分钟。","img":"images/634594/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"平底锅预热，倒油。","img":"images/634594/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入一半蚝肉糊糊，小火慢煎。","img":"images/634594/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻面再煎。","img":"images/634594/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"鸡蛋提前打散搅匀。倒入蚝仔煎上。","img":"images/634594/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"煎熟后分成小块。","img":"images/634594/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"装盘撒香菜。","img":"images/634594/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}